{
  "id": "E315",
  "title": "Sale at the Shopping Mall",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-04-14",
  "synopsis": "The shopping mall next to the school is having a big discount.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1016/eb2975422031f26e32041ed86c0be8b9dc171e00.mp3?1554468407",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "那个商场在打折\n\n小乐：你听说了吗？万达商场这个周末有大折扣啊！\n丽丽：是我们学校旁边那个商场吗？\n小乐：是啊，他们有好多活动。化妆品全部九折，女装买三送一，男装部分半价。\n丽丽：这么便宜，那我们周末一起去看看吧！",
    "traditional": "那個商場在打折\n\n小樂：你聽說了嗎？萬達商場這個週末有大折扣啊！\n麗麗：是我們學校旁邊那個商場嗎？\n小樂：是啊，他們有好多活動。化妝品全部九折，女裝買三送一，男裝部分半價。\n麗麗：這麼便宜，那我們週末一起去看看吧！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "That shopping mall is having a sale"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：你听说了吗？万达商场这个周末有大折扣啊！",
      "traditional": "小樂：你聽說了嗎？萬達商場這個週末有大折扣啊！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ tīng shuō le ma wàn dá shāng chǎng zhè ge zhōu mò yǒu dà zhé kòu a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Have you heard? Wanda Shopping Mall is going to have a big sale this weekend!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：是我们学校旁边那个商场吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：是我們學校旁邊那個商場嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì shì wǒ men xué xiào páng biān nà ge shāng chǎng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Is that the shopping mall next to our school?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：是啊，他们有好多活动。",
      "traditional": "小樂：是啊，他們有好多活動。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shì a tā men yǒu hǎo duō huó dòng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "化妆品全部九折，",
      "traditional": "化妝品全部九折，",
      "pinyin": "huà zhuāng pǐn quán bù jiǔ zhé",
      "english": "Little Le: Yes, they have a lot of offers."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "女装买三送一，男装部分半价。",
      "traditional": "女裝買三送一，男裝部分半價。",
      "pinyin": "nǚ zhuāng mǎi sān sòng yī nán zhuāng bù fen bàn jià",
      "english": "All makeup products are 10% off."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Women’s clothes are “buy three get one free” and some men’s clothes are half price."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：这么便宜，那我们周末一起去看看吧！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：這麼便宜，那我們週末一起去看看吧！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zhè me pián yi nà wǒ men zhōu mò yì qǐ qù kàn kan ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: How cheap! Let’s go there together this weekend!"
    }
  ],
